From 15e76960e81f3fcbfb9333ee801e29ca11545459 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bherbruck <brennen.herbruck@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:48:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ui): spindle speed editable on the Feeds tab, as rpm
 or surface speed

The Feeds tab's Cutting data group gets an editable Spindle speed row
with an rpm / surface switch (m/min in a mm document, SFM in an inch
one, through the tool's diameter). The speed is the op tool's, so a
committed value is one undoable ChangeTool - on drag release or Enter,
never per frame - and the hover says it edits the tool for every
operation using it.

Fixes #225

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
