From 40fd7ba065d886e7ab8e45ccc2329fdef10c576d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:12:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(ui): name the tool diameter when surface speed has
 none; hold to spindle_max

A zero tool diameter in surface mode said the speed must be above zero;
it now says the tool diameter must be above zero to show or set surface
speed. A committed speed over the machine's stated spindle_max is held to
it with a status note, and the row's hover names the machine maximum.

Refs #225

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
